{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":45.47999954223633,"text":"Philarimos is a hill of about 270 meters with a view over the whole northwest coast. Ialisos stood on top of it, one of the three ancient cities of the island that joined together to make roads. The foundations of a temple of Athena survive, and a Doric fountain house cut into the rock. Beside them stands a monastery built by the knights and rebuilt by the Italians, and from there a path lined with cypress trees leads to an enormous cross. The cross is not only there to be looked at, it has a staircase inside, and you climb up into its horizontal arms. And all over the hill peacocks wander about, entirely unafraid of you, opening their tails whenever they feel like it.","words":[{"word":"Philarimos","start":0,"end":0.8799999952316284},{"word":"is","start":0.8799999952316284,"end":1.340000033378601},{"word":"a","start":1.340000033378601,"end":1.8200000524520874},{"word":"hill","start":1.8200000524520874,"end":1.8200000524520874},{"word":"of","start":1.8200000524520874,"end":2.119999885559082},{"word":"about","start":2.119999885559082,"end":2.4000000953674316},{"word":"270","start":2.4000000953674316,"end":3.5999999046325684},{"word":"meters","start":3.5999999046325684,"end":3.9800000190734863},{"word":"with","start":3.9800000190734863,"end":4.599999904632568},{"word":"a","start":4.599999904632568,"end":5.019999980926514},{"word":"view","start":5.019999980926514,"end":5.019999980926514},{"word":"over","start":5.019999980926514,"end":5.300000190734863},{"word":"the","start":5.300000190734863,"end":5.480000019073486},{"word":"whole","start":5.480000019073486,"end":5.920000076293945},{"word":"northwest","start":5.920000076293945,"end":6.360000133514404},{"word":"coast","start":6.360000133514404,"end":6.860000133514404},{"word":"Ialisos","start":7.900000095367432,"end":8.15999984741211},{"word":"stood","start":8.15999984741211,"end":8.420000076293945},{"word":"on","start":8.420000076293945,"end